<title>SINGAPORE: Osprey Maritime reorganises businesses.</title>
<headline>Osprey Maritime reorganises businesses.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ship charter company Osprey Maritime Ltd said on Tuesday it had reorganised its businesses to improve efficiency and improve service to clients.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its 23 existing crude oil and product tankers were being placed in two new businesses, one operating the six crude oil carriers and the other operating the 17 oil product tankers.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
